<title>CHINA: BankAmerica unit BA Asia sets HK$ FRCD.</title>
<headline>BankAmerica unit BA Asia sets HK$ FRCD.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was</p>
<p>announced by arranger BA Asia.</p>
<p>BORROWER  BANK OF AMERICA ASIA</p>
<p>	     THE BORROWER IS A SUBSIDIARY OF BANK OF AMERICA</p>
<p> AMOUNT   HK$1.5 BLN COUPON    1MH+25 BP MATURITY DUE SEPT.00</p>
<p> TYPE     FRCD	 ISS PRICE PAR	 LAUNCH   11.JUL.97</p>
<p> PUTS     NONE	 CALLS     NONE	REPLIES  25.JUL.97</p>
<p> LISTING  NONE	 REPAYMENT BULLET    DENOMS   HK$1 MLN</p>
<p> RATING   *	    SALE LMTS STANDARD  TAX PROV  --</p>
<p> NEG PLG  YES	  CRS DEF   YES	 FORCE MAJ  YES</p>
<p> HOME     U.S	  GOV LAW  HONG KONG  PAY DATE  12.SEPT.97</p>
